            "review_title": "Review at Sunflower Restaurant",
            "review_text": "woodsdancer\nNha Trang, Viet Nam23 contributions\n0\ncant get their act together\nOct 2014 • Friends\nThus restaurant has a great setting, feeling like a jungle village, with lots of outdoor seating and thatched roofed structures, gardens and open areas. A nice looking menu/cuisine. \nIt is a good idea: a cooking school with restaurant. But they just cant get it all together. Service can be absolutely terrible waiters can be totally confused. Delivery can be excruciatingly slow.\nI was very impressed when I first saw it but have given up going there entirely\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 16, 2014",
